### Criando categoria

POST http://localhost:3000/categories HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Bolo Personalizado",
    "slug": "bolo_personalizado"
}

### Ler products

GET http://localhost:3000/categories HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json


### Ler products por id

GET http://localhost:3000/categories/by-slug/bolos-fixos/products HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json